{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40534,"sections":[{"id":"script-20534","name":"原始脚本 20534","scripts":[20534],"start":0,"count":45}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:1","scriptId":20534,"text":"自从有了波西娅的支援，兰布达的义体研究比起之前快了不少，不过最近好像陷入了瓶颈期。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:2","scriptId":20534,"text":"（看你的样子，最近好像没什么进展嘛，兰布达。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:3","scriptId":20534,"text":"（如您所见，现在的进度主要是卡在测试上，缺少一个可以测试的环境。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:4","scriptId":20534,"text":"（测试的环境？死水周边不是有很多可以用来测试的地方吗？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:5","scriptId":20534,"text":"（虽然我也想这么做，但这个提议并没有被通过。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:6","scriptId":20534,"text":"（怎么说？波西娅吗？不应该啊，我印象里她算是个很破格的人类，绝对不会。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:7","scriptId":20534,"text":"（是这样没错，但是波西娅呈交了测试报告之后，被告知维多利亚不允许我们这么做。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:8","scriptId":20534,"text":"（哦？是她啊，那倒是有这可能。维多利亚是个比较谨慎的人，野外测试还是有些风险的。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:9","scriptId":20534,"text":"艾丽莎起身倒了杯水，然后往里面灌了一包速溶咖啡粉，这是她近期比较喜欢喝的东西，前段时间的柠檬汁已经喝腻了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:10","scriptId":20534,"text":"接着艾丽莎又坐回到了原来的沙发上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:11","scriptId":20534,"text":"（那接下来你打算怎么办？说来听听）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:12","scriptId":20534,"text":"（考虑把样本小型化，然后就可以在这实验室进行测试了。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:13","scriptId":20534,"text":"（听上去好像是个可行的办法，那然后呢？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:14","scriptId":20534,"text":"（完全不行……以这里的工具和技术要小型化制作样本难度非常巨大，我现在基本已经打消了这个念头。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:15","scriptId":20534,"text":"（这就很麻烦了，实在不行，让柯西来扭曲一下维多利亚的思维，强行允许测试？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:16","scriptId":20534,"text":"（我也考虑过这个问题，但柯西做事的手法我不是特别喜欢，而且万一她那过分的操作导致维多利亚发生了什么问题就……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:17","scriptId":20534,"text":"（也对，我还想多在这里玩玩呢。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:18","scriptId":20534,"text":"（那个……如果可以的话，让德尔塔来这里如何？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:19","scriptId":20534,"text":"（德尔塔？？？……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:20","scriptId":20534,"text":"（哦哦～我明白了，要用她的模拟技术是吧。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:21","scriptId":20534,"text":"（是的……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:22","scriptId":20534,"text":"（那也行，明天我就召她过来。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:24","scriptId":20534,"text":"第二天——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:25","scriptId":20534,"text":"“动作都快点，还没把隔壁的仓库清出来吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:26","scriptId":20534,"text":"“已经是最快速度了……那仓库里堆了不少东西。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:27","scriptId":20534,"text":"“那就再快点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:28","scriptId":20534,"text":"突然到访的旅行者德尔塔让我们措手不及——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:29","scriptId":20534,"text":"德尔塔是来协助兰布达进行研究，所以暂时就又由我们小队进行监管了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:30","scriptId":20534,"text":"虽说已经接纳了兰布达和埃普西隆，但德尔塔这种大型的旅行者，我们还真没接触过。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:31","scriptId":20534,"text":"我走出研究室，来到了隔壁的仓库，这里将会是德尔塔暂居的地方，波西娅要求我们在一天之内完成清仓工作。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:32","scriptId":20534,"text":"“这搬运的工作量太大了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:33","scriptId":20534,"text":"“真是弱小，一次只能搬运这么点东西，让我的斯卡博也帮你们一起搬吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:34","scriptId":20534,"text":"说完，就看到德尔塔身边的巨型骸虫钻进了仓库中，那不符合体型的灵巧动作简直让人瞠目结舌。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:35","scriptId":20534,"text":"“哦！？还能这么方便的？我看兰布达她们都没这种能力嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:36","scriptId":20534,"text":"“我的斯卡博是特殊的，本身就和兰布达她们不同。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:37","scriptId":20534,"text":"“真是太感谢了……不然这仓库搬运肯定要很久。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:38","scriptId":20534,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:39","scriptId":20534,"text":"“你这口气……好像已经习惯和我们这些异邦人打交道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:40","scriptId":20534,"text":"德尔塔一边控制着骸虫斯卡博进行搬运，一边在嘴里嘟囔着什么。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:41","scriptId":20534,"text":"“不知道艾丽莎大人是看上了你哪一点了...竟然让我来协助你们。老实说这种合作关系其实并不会牢固的。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:42","scriptId":20534,"text":"“艾丽莎大人？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:43","scriptId":20534,"text":"德尔塔的动作有那么一丝的僵直，但紧接着她又恢复了流畅的操作。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:44","scriptId":20534,"text":"“你听错了，是兰布达。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:45","scriptId":20534,"text":"“要烦劳你这个客人动手真是不好意思啊…以后还请多关照了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20534:20534:46","scriptId":20534,"text":"“哼，奇怪的家伙。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
